It served disadvantaged African-American kids in Ipsilanti, Michigan. I was what? 23? I'm 24, it's hard to imagine now. I'm 79 now, so it was a while ago. Her lessons with the preschoolers appeared simple, but they usually had a hidden curriculum. Louise encouraged the kids to develop

