even. But IQ tends to be fixed at least in terms of your rank and the IQ distribution by somewhere 10 to 12, you know, varies among people, but then it becomes much harder to change it. However, personality traits are actually emerging. And so if you look at the work on neuroscience, you look at the work on behavior science. Many, many excellent behavioral people, they're showing that many more what we can think of as personality

